        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dick Crealy, Mary Pierce\n- Roles: tennis players\n- Events: Australian Open, Davis Cup, Olympics\n- Organizations: Women's Tennis Association (WTA)\n\nFacts:\n- Dick Crealy was born on 18 September 1944 and is an Australian former tennis player.\n- In 1970, Dick Crealy reached the finals of the Australian Open.\n- In 1970, Dick Crealy was a member of the Australian Davis Cup Team.\n- Dick Crealy won four Grand Slam titles in doubles.\n- Mary Pierce was born on 15 January 1975 and is a French retired tennis professional.\n- Mary Pierce played on the Women's Tennis Association tour.\n- Mary Pierce represented France in team competitions and in the Olympics.",
